OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 24, dies in three-car crash
OL,4,Ain Fife as driver taken to hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 24-year-old woman has died in a
OL,7,Fthree-car crash that took place in Fife
OL,8,Fin the early hours of Sunday.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on the A92 near
OL,11,FLuthrie at about 01:00 and involved a
OL,12,Fwhite Audi A3, a grey Volvo V40 and a
OL,13,Fwhite Honda HRV.
OL,15,FThe woman who died was a passenger in
OL,16,Fthe Audi. A 27-year-old man, who was
OL,17,Fdriving that car, was taken to
OL,18,FNinewells hospital for treatment.
OL,20,FThere were no other injuries. Police
OL,21,FScotland said investigations into the
OL,22,Fincident were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
